'''Zang Roo''' (スカルボクサー, ''Sukaru Bokusā'', '''Skull Boxer''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Kang Roo]] that appears in [[Zombie Outbreaks]], [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

