==Enemy==
Easily the strongest Zombie peon, Zang Roo moves slower than [[Shadow Boxer K]] but only has 2 knockbacks, making her very difficult to fend off should she appear at your base - which is more likely than not with her 1125-distance burrow. She also revives with full HP if not done in by a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] and outranges [[Li'l Bird Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Flying Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]], though due to her backswing, the latter's high burst damage allows him to practically sneak in one hit or two even at a range disadvantage.

Zang Roo's backswing is just long enough for her to be stalled indefinitely when by herself, but combined with just about any support (including but not limited to other Zang Roos), she can plow through your attackers with ease. It is recommended to "waste" her burrow by either knocking back or killing her before she burrows, timing the [[Cat Cannon]] so that it hits her right before she burrows, forcing her to burrow early, or firing the [[Holy Blast]] before things get any worse.

