==Trivia==
*Zang Roo's Japanese description suggesting she lost the ability to tell gloves apart explains why she uses skulls instead, but may also imply her eyesight had gotten so bad she could no longer distinguish between opponents' left and right gloves, which would easily have ended her career as a boxer.
*Before [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] gave Zang Roo Multi-Hit, her 7,997 damage was in a single hit on the 8th frame of her attack animation.

